<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Pourquoi je vois ceci ?</title>
    <style>
    :root {
        --primary-color: #18E3A4;
        --primary-dark: #13c891;
        --text-color: #E6FFF6;
        --text-secondary: #B0B9B6;
        --bg-primary: #1A1F1E;
        --bg-dark: #0D0F0F;
        --card-bg: rgba(26, 31, 30, 0.7);
    }

    body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-primary), var(--bg-dark));
        color: var(--text-color);
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .why-page-wrap {
        max-width: 1080px;
        margin: 2rem auto;
        padding: 0 1rem 2.25rem;
    }

    .why-header {
        margin-bottom: 1.7rem;
    }

    .why-header h1 {
        color: var(--primary-color, #18E3A4);
        margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
        font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 2.7vw, 2.45rem);
        letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        text-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(24, 227, 164, 0.22);
    }

    .why-header p {
        color: var(--text-secondary, #B0B9B6);
        margin: 0;
    }

    .why-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 0.96fr 1.04fr;
        gap: 1rem;
    }

    .why-panel,
    .universe-card {
        background: var(--card-bg, rgba(26, 31, 30, 0.7));
        border: 1px solid rgba(24, 227, 164, 0.18);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 0.95rem;
        backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
        transition: box-shadow 0.22s ease, transform 0.22s ease, border-color 0.22s ease;
    }

    .why-panel:hover,
    .universe-card:hover {
        border-color: rgba(24, 227, 164, 0.3);
        box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.32), 0 0 16px rgba(24, 227, 164, 0.16);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .ai-panel {
        border-color: rgba(24, 227, 164, 0.42);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(24, 227, 164, 0.15) inset, 0 0 20px rgba(24, 227, 164, 0.16);
    }

    .why-panel h3 {
        color: var(--primary-color, #18E3A4);
        margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    }

    .why-ai-text {
        color: var(--text-color, #E6FFF6);
        line-height: 1.55;
        animation: aiFadeIn 320ms ease;
    }

    @keyframes aiFadeIn {
        from {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(4px);
        }
        to {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }
    }

    .signal-row {
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .signal-label {
        color: var(--text-secondary, #B0B9B6);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .signal-subtext {
        color: var(--text-secondary, #B0B9B6);
        font-size: 0.76rem;
        margin-top: 0.28rem;
        opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .signal-track {
        width: 100%;
        height: 8px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .signal-fill {
        height: 100%;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary-color, #18E3A4), var(--primary-dark, #13c891));
    }

    .chips {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .chip {
        padding: 0.3rem 0.65rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(24, 227, 164, 0.35);
        color: var(--primary-color, #18E3A4);
        background: rgba(24, 227, 164, 0.1);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .why-actions {
        margin-top: 1rem;
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
        border-radius: 10px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn-secondary {
        border: 1px solid var(--primary-color);
        color: var(--primary-color);
        background: transparent;
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
        background: rgba(24, 227, 164, 0.1);
    }

    .btn-primary {
        background: var(--primary-color);
        color: #0d0f0f;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
        background: var(--primary-dark);
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .why-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="why-page-wrap">
    <div style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        <a href="{{ path('discover') }}" class="btn btn-secondary">← Retour</a>
    </div>

    <div class="why-header">
        <h1>Pourquoi je vois ceci ?</h1>
        <p>Explication hybride: signaux de recommandation + interprétation IA.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="why-grid">
        <div class="universe-card">
            <div class="card-type">{{ postDetails.typeLabel }}</div>
            <h2 class="card-title">{{ postDetails.title }}</h2>
            <div class="card-genre-tags">
                <span class="genre-tag">{{ post.tag }}</span>
            </div>
            <p class="card-description">{{ postDetails.description|default('') }}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="why-panel ai-panel">
            <h3>Explication IA</h3>
            <p class="why-ai-text">{{ aiExplanation }}</p>

            <h3 style="margin-top:1rem;">Signaux</h3>
            {% set b = post.score_breakdown %}

            <div class="signal-row">
                <div class="signal-label"><span>Tag Match</span></div>
                <div class="signal-track"><div class="signal-fill" style="width: {{ (b.tag_similarity * 100)|round(0) }}%;"></div></div>
                <div class="signal-subtext">Alignement avec vos intérêts</div>
            </div>

            <div class="signal-row">
                <div class="signal-label"><span>Engagement</span></div>
                <div class="signal-track"><div class="signal-fill" style="width: {{ (b.engagement_score * 100)|round(0) }}%;"></div></div>
                <div class="signal-subtext">Popularité du contenu</div>
            </div>

            <div class="signal-row">
                <div class="signal-label"><span>Récence</span></div>
                <div class="signal-track"><div class="signal-fill" style="width: {{ (b.recency_decay * 100)|round(0) }}%;"></div></div>
                <div class="signal-subtext">Publié récemment</div>
            </div>

            <div class="signal-row">
                <div class="signal-label"><span>Comportement</span></div>
                <div class="signal-track"><div class="signal-fill" style="width: {{ (b.behavior_similarity * 100)|round(0) }}%;"></div></div>
                <div class="signal-subtext">Basé sur vos interactions</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="why-grid" style="margin-top:1rem;">
        <div class="why-panel">
            <h3>Vos signaux de profil</h3>
            <p class="signal-label">Top tags de préférences</p>
            <div class="chips">
                {% for tag in topPreferenceTags %}
                    <span class="chip">{{ tag }}</span>
                {% else %}
                    <span class="signal-label">Aucun tag de préférence.</span>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>

            <p class="signal-label" style="margin-top:0.9rem;">Top tags de comportement</p>
            <div class="chips">
                {% for tag in topBehaviorTags %}
                    <span class="chip">{{ tag }}</span>
                {% else %}
                    <span class="signal-label">Aucun signal comportemental.</span>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        </div>

        <div></div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
